WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.542 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Ladies and gentlemen, welcome!

2
00:00:04.542 --> 00:00:12.230 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
A surprise: we won't wait until December to meet again… there'll be the annual summer barbecue!

3
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:18.295 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
And tonight? Two surprises!

4
00:00:18.295 --> 00:00:20.541 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
A glass jar and a little ticket,

5
00:00:20.541 --> 00:00:22.456 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
fate picks your table, that's the trick!

6
00:00:22.456 --> 00:00:24.605 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Then you'll choose your seat,

7
00:00:24.605 --> 00:00:26.946 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
old friends and new faces to meet.

8
00:00:26.946 --> 00:00:28.870 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Even the CEOs, just for one night,

9
00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.226 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
leave it to chance to get it right!

10
00:00:31.226 --> 00:00:37.910 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
A special welcome to Naimo and Sandra, and to our future colleague Matteo!

11
00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:41.637 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Now it's your turn: there's a QR code on every table.

12
00:00:41.637 --> 00:00:50.502 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Scan it, pick your name and suggest two things: a story, true or made up, and a music style.

13
00:00:50.502 --> 00:00:57.785 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
A few words are enough: artificial intelligence will take care of the song!

14
00:00:57.785 --> 00:01:01.945 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
A story, a feeling,

15
00:01:01.945 --> 00:01:06.379 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
turns into a song worth singing!

16
00:01:06.379 --> 00:01:09.669 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Pop, blues or serenade:

17
00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:14.350 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
your idea is on its way!

18
00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:23.576 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Everyone will get their own song. The AI will pick three finalists; then we'll all vote with our applause, on the applause meter!

19
00:01:23.576 --> 00:01:31.945 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
The prize: a hundred-franc voucher!

20
00:01:31.945 --> 00:01:35.855 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
It's Christmas, what a lovely night,

21
00:01:35.855 --> 00:01:39.855 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
full of laughter and songs so bright!

22
00:01:39.855 --> 00:01:43.880 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
Let the music start the party,

23
00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:48.535 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
and may the most surprising idea win!

24
00:01:48.535 --> 00:01:51.870 line:5% position:50% align:center size:92%
But first… let's see who we're having dinner with!
